                      <Pad Id="F3a7cQ7UhdmLZ4mbKuVHj8" Bounds="560,1030,452,171" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Controls is a live ObservableCollection. The engine sets no dispatcher, so the follower changes the collection on a thread pool thread while the mainloop runs the patch. A change during an enumeration throws &quot;Collection was modified&quot;.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Spread.FromSequence copies the collection. The window for the throw goes from the whole loop, which is slow because it creates prefabs, down to the copy, which takes microseconds.">
                        <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
                          <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
                        </p:TypeAnnotation>
                        <p:ValueBoxSettings>
